{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":61,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["大喜的訊息"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["主耶和華的靈在我身上，因為耶和華膏立了我，",{"text":"讓我傳福音給貧窮的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"差遣我醫治傷心的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"宣告被擄的人得釋放、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被囚的人得自由；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"宣告耶和華的恩年和我們上帝報仇的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"安慰一切悲哀的人；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以華冠取代錫安哀傷者頭上的灰塵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以喜樂的膏油取代他們的哀傷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以頌讚的外袍取代他們的灰心。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們將被稱為耶和華所栽種的公義橡樹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以彰顯祂的榮耀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必重修古老的荒場，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"修復久已毀壞之地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"重建歷代荒廢的城邑。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"異鄉客要為你們牧放羊群，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"外族人要為你們耕種田地、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"照料葡萄園。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要被稱為耶和華的祭司，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們上帝的臣僕。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們必享用各國的財富，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誇耀自己擁有他們的榮華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們曾經蒙受恥辱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如今將得到雙倍的福分；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們曾經遭受屈辱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如今將因得到產業而快樂。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們將在自己的土地上得到雙倍的福分，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"享受永遠的快樂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"「因為我耶和華喜愛公正，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"憎惡搶劫之罪。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必憑信實賞賜我的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"與他們立永遠的約。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的後代必享譽列國，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"子孫必名聞萬邦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看見的人都承認他們是蒙耶和華賜福之民。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"我因耶和華而無比喜樂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我的上帝而心裡快樂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為祂給我穿上救恩的衣服、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"披上公義的袍子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我像戴上華冠的新郎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像戴上飾物的新娘。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地怎樣使嫩苗長出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"園子怎樣使種子發芽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主耶和華必照樣使公義與頌讚在萬民中滋長。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/61.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/62.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/60.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}